So first, diabetes is a really

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.460
a major non-communicable
disease worldwide.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.990
And actually, many
scientists have called it

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.913
a pandemic of itself.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:05.080
So kind of understanding

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.500
diabetes in the context of COVID-19

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.790
is really important given
its really widespread nature

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.640
and how quickly it's been
spreading throughout the world.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:20.080
Second, so diabetes is known to present

