00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.500
when it's combined with
respiratory illnesses.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.920
So, it's already been known
that diabetes is kind of

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.410
a really major pre-existing
